    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Heart of Summer</strong> is a dating sim set in a classic anime school setting, just like in your favourite romcom! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transfer to a new high school and experience your senior year in a new town. You are faced with the excitement of making the most of your last summer as a student, so it's up to you to live it out and try to get that hot, high school girlfriend that you've always wanted! <i>If you can...</i><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras/4a9da408a307b717c1f1e760b0ed49a2.avif?t=1754131877\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>5 different GIRLS to DATE\u00a0</strong></i>\u2014\u00a0<i><strong>5 different ROUTES to PLAY!\u00a0</strong></i>+ numerous BAD endings!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>School uniforms, miniskirts, loose socks, bloomers, school swimsuits, bikinis, yukatas, maids...</i> <i><strong>something for every taste!</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <i>A true artistic tribute to the HIGH SCHOOL GIRL AESTHETICA.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">On your mission to get a girlfriend, you may run into...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A SERIAL KILLER OR A CURSE...</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>THE ITALIAN MAFIA!</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>EMOS!?</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>SKATEBOARDING!!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>AN OCCULT SECRET SOCIETY!?</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras/97eae69734c2e58f5a9e67494e6aa088.avif?t=1754131877\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPERIENCE ANIME SCHOOL LIFE IN THE SUMMER!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your clothes wet in the rain during the rainy season!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Study (or don't) for exams!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live out your carefree after school life as a real Going-Home-Clubber!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try not to finish last in the Sports Festival!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Feel the heat during the best summer vacation you'll ever have!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go on a SCHOOL TRIP with your class!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">      ...and much more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The anime school life full of twists and turns is waiting for you;<strong><i> and, in this show, you're the main character!</i></strong>\u00a0This summer, it's going to be hot, sunny and off the wall, so whatever happens, don't think it's going to be that simple: you're about to find out just how serious chasing skirt can be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1394990/extras/2d1d49b24e11d348ce1af9dc4b52aeb2.avif?t=1754131877\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Buyer's insurance: even if you cannot get a girlfriend the game studio <strong>\u00a9Akehabara</strong> GUARANTEES to you a free\u2014yes, FREE\u2014best friend from your class.</p>",
